0;font-size:13px;color:#4fb3aa">❄ 冰点进攻窗 · 触发</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#98a0ab;margin-top:2px">温度&lt;25 · A档:y1+0.30%/胜率60%(n=15/12段)</div></div><div style="flex:1;min-width:190px;border:1px solid #33383f;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#5b636d">☢ 过热禁追窗 · 灭</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#5b636d;margin-top:2px">温度≥85 · A档:0/6全负·-1.86%</div></div><div style="flex:1;min-width:190px;border:1px solid #d9a441;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:rgba(217,164,65,.06)"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#d9a441">♨ 洗出反弹窗 · 触发</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#98a0ab;margin-top:2px">溢价连负3日 · A档:+0.46%/65%(n=34)·只反弹不反转</div></div></div><div style="font-size:11px;color:#6b7683;margin-top:8px">读法:柱线剪刀口张开(涨停创高而金线趴地)=数量繁荣×接力冰点;三窗战绩=2025-07~2026-07单牛市周期回测,小样本,给环境判断不给指令。已证伪:复合&quot;冰点+≥2转机分量&quot;硬条件。</div></div><!--/LEADIND--></div><div class="card"><div class="" id="claim-cycle-783b48cc05c9d66b"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>二 先行指标</p><div class="claim-proof"><span class="proof-label">证据回链</span><a href="#evidence-ev-cycle-783b48cc05c9d66b" title="ev-cycle-783b48cc05c9d66b">来源</a></div></div></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-a16def27488753ef"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="card"><p>[实证] 明确以09-10为前一交易日：一进二率11.5%，二进三率33.3%，高度晋级率37.5%；核按钮2/35=5.7%。连续板口径与普通连板数分布不同；有间断涨停不按连续晋级计。指标提示与C档防守并存，不单独触发开仓。</p></div><div class="claim-proof"><span class="proof-label">证据回链</span><a href="#evidence-ev-cycle-a16def27488753ef" title="ev-cycle-a16def27488753ef">来源</a></div></div></section><section id="stages"><h2>三 情绪五阶段 · 五路周期投票</h2><div id="component-MACHVOTE"><!--MACHVOTE--><!--VOTEBOARD--><div style="margin:10px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#14171e;border:1px solid #2a2f3a;border-radius:10px">
